\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 1. O Jesus, I have promised
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To serve you to the end;
\par Be now and ever near me;
\par My master and my friend;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I shall not fear the battle
\par If you are by my side,
\par Nor wander from the pathway
\par If you will be my guide.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  O let me feel you near me;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The world is ever near;
\par I see the sights that dazzle,
\par The tempting sounds I hear;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My enemies are near me,
\par Around me and within;
\par But Jesus, draw still nearer,
\par And shield my soul from sin.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O let me hear you speaking
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 In accents clear and still,
\par Above the storms of passion,
\par The murmurs of self-will;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Lord, speak to reassure me,
\par To hasten or control;
\par Lord, speak, and make me listen,
\par Great guardian of my soul
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O Jesus, you have promised,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 To all who follow you,
\par That where you are in glory
\par Your servants shall be too;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And, Jesus, I have promised
\par To serve you to the end:
\par So give me grace to follow,
\par \pard      My master and my friend\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

